---
title: Reactor
id: reactor-adapter
description: "Generate live worlds and video with Reactor models in TanStack AI via the @tanstack/ai-reactor adapter."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - reactor
  - world generation
  - live generation
  - orbis
  - helios
  - generateWorld
  - generateLiveVideo
  - adapter
---
